cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or data, please cite the accompanying paper (see preferred-citation)."
title: "Quantum Selection: reproduction package for 'Cost-Aware Regression Test Prioritization for Quantum Compilers: Pre-Registered Evidence from Qiskit'"
abstract: >-
  Code, frozen data, configurations, environment recipes and analysis scripts that reproduce
  the computational results of an empirical study of cost-aware regression test selection
  for the Qiskit transpiler, comparing a transparent cost-aware selector with simple
  baselines (random, cheapest-first, diversity, history and change-stage orderings).
